10 distinct passing tests across incremental builds. Earlier executions and the superseded census failures are retained below.
The initial compile and first replay run were intermediate sources. After the two-case replay run, only census, tests and comments changed; forward/compensate was selected again after sharing its setup with commit/prune.
The paired-leaf run preceded that test-only fixture refactor. The eight-case batch preceded the census assertion update. Final changes to production source after that batch were comments and dead-code lint annotations.
The case and final source blob inventory is in module-gate/records/20261120-dev3-08-3-o2c.json.
Commands used /tmp/o2c-cargo with the isolated Cargo target and offline dependencies. Focused tests used RUST_MIN_STACK=33554432.
